From: WorkBuddy AI <buddy@workbuddy>
Date: Wed, 30 Jul 2026 18:52:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11] fix: make CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR conditional on STM32_M33TDCID

ST's CMakeLists.txt unconditionally defines CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR via
target_compile_definitions(), which bypasses the cmake command-line
-DCRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR=OFF flag.

On D-variant (STM32MP257DAK), SAES hardware crypto is absent but
CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR being defined causes the mbedtls hardware
accelerator path to be compiled, leading to attempts to access
SAES_CR register (0x52050004) at boot -> BusFault.

Root cause: target_compile_definitions() injects the C preprocessor
macro directly, completely bypassing cmake cache variables set via
-DCRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR=OFF on the command line.

Fix: Wrap all three CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR definitions in
if(STM32_M33TDCID) ... endif() blocks. LEGACY_DRIVER_API_ENABLED
remains unconditional.

Signed-off-by: WorkBuddy AI <buddy@workbuddy>
---
 platform/ext/accelerator/stm32mp2/CMakeLists.txt | 39 ++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

--- a/platform/ext/accelerator/stm32mp2/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/platform/ext/accelerator/stm32mp2/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -22,9 +22,17 @@
 
 ################################ BL2 ###########################################
 if(BL2)
+    # CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR requires SAES hardware (TDCID).
+    # On D-variant chips (no TDCID), enabling this causes BusFault
+    # at tfm_builtin_key_loader_init() accessing SAES_CR (0x52050004).
+    if(STM32_M33TDCID)
+        target_compile_definitions(platform_bl2
+            PRIVATE
+                CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
+        )
+    endif()
     target_compile_definitions(platform_bl2
         PRIVATE
-            CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
             LEGACY_DRIVER_API_ENABLED
     )
 
@@ -35,9 +43,14 @@
 
     set(STM_LIB_TARGET bl2_crypto_hw)
 
+    if(STM32_M33TDCID)
+        target_compile_definitions(bl2_mbedcrypto
+            PUBLIC
+                CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
+        )
+    endif()
     target_compile_definitions(bl2_mbedcrypto
         PUBLIC
-            CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
             LEGACY_DRIVER_API_ENABLED
     )
 
@@ -57,9 +70,14 @@
             crypto_service_crypto_hw
     )
 
+    if(STM32_M33TDCID)
+        target_compile_definitions(crypto_service_mbedcrypto
+            PUBLIC
+                CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
+        )
+    endif()
     target_compile_definitions(crypto_service_mbedcrypto
         PUBLIC
-            CRYPTO_HW_ACCELERATOR
             LEGACY_DRIVER_API_ENABLED
     )
 

